# Firebase service account keys. These are REAL credentials: one can send a
# notification to every device registered to the project. Mount the file at
# runtime and point FCM_CREDENTIALS_FILE at it; never commit one.
*service-account*.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
# Ignore everything dropped in here, but keep the directory itself: the
# docker-compose bind mount requires it to exist on a fresh clone.
backend/secrets/*
!backend/secrets/README.md
